From de4cb51631912fab4d4528cda408e5e33b42814b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:43:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: retain typed PWA audit identities without session
 secrets

Convert six PWA audit/lifecycle producers, retaining Info or HTTP Debug,
readable messages, effective peer semantics and authentication behavior.
Only identities and addresses already displayed are captured. Passwords,
request bodies, cookies, CSRF values and one-time tokens remain excluded.
The app source gets its own wallet_app_source field.

Extend the existing interface_wallet_pwa security control with failed login,
token login, rejected origin, logout revocation, and secret omission in JSON
logs after logger flush. Do not assert replacement event/field spellings,
exact formatted messages, producer severity or per-conversion schema details.
The non-loopback transport refusal remains covered by its existing control.
Shared eCash tier: after the PWA HTTP owner, before V2 adaptations.

Scripted-diff commands (ast-grep-py==0.51.0):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/wallet-pwa-audit-diagnostics.json --report /private/tmp/wallet-pwa-source-proof.json --apply
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/walletpwa/http.cpp
  /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/n4-harness-intake/venv/bin/ruff format test/functional/interface_wallet_pwa.py

Bounded source checks: exact AST mapping/replay idempotence, typed-event
lint (six sites), Ruff 0.15.8 and git diff --check pass.
SOURCE ONLY: NOT_COMPILED and functional test NOT_RUN. No runtime or
performance evidence is claimed; current integration benchmarks take priority.
